LINES = [{'id': 'rule', 'text': "In this town, if you complain about something, it vanishes forever. Leo said, 'Ugh, burnt toast!' Poof!"}, {'id': 'coffee', 'text': 'Dad complained his coffee was cold. Poof, no coffee machine. Now he yawns all day.'}, {'id': 'never', 'text': "So I never complain. Not once in eleven years. Even when Dad's bread tastes like socks."}, {'id': 'test', 'text': 'Owen complained about the spelling test. Poof, no test. Kids love it. Teachers, not so much.'}, {'id': 'mart', 'text': "Then Mr. Bruno opened Bruno's Mart. Just to test, he complained about a fire hydrant. Poof."}, {'id': 'cake', 'text': "Gus's bread was cheaper, so Bruno marched into the bakery. 'This cake is too sweet!' Poof."}, {'id': 'cupcakes', 'text': "'These cupcakes are too tiny!' Poof. Gus had nothing left to sell, so his bakery closed."}, {'id': 'price', 'text': "Now Bruno's was the only shop left. Bread: one hundred fifty dollars. I almost complained."}, {'id': 'wild', 'text': 'Then he went wild. The bench was too hard, the swings too squeaky, the tree too shady!'}, {'id': 'mayor', 'text': "The Mayor yelled, 'Stop it!' Bruno said the Mayor was too bossy. Poof. No more Mayor."}, {'id': 'leo', 'text': "My brother Leo laughed at him. 'Kids are too noisy!' Bruno yelled. And Leo vanished."}, {'id': 'brave', 'text': "My knees were shaking, but I walked right up and said, 'You're the best complainer ever.'"}, {'id': 'proud', 'text': "He puffed up. 'Of course! I'm so sick of everyone else's whiny complaining!'"}, {'id': 'twist', 'text': 'Uh oh. He just complained about complaining. So complaining itself vanished. Forever. Even the rule sign!'}, {'id': 'back', 'text': 'Everything came back! The bench, the swings, the tree, the Mayor, and my brother Leo!'}, {'id': 'baker', 'text': 'Bruno stomped and complained. Nothing vanished. Now he bakes cupcakes for Gus, and bread costs one dollar.'}, {'id': 'toast', 'text': 'Leo still complains about burnt toast every morning. But the toaster stays. He just eats it.'}]
